 "modules": [
  {
   "id": 1,
   "plugin": "Core",
   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "FRAME & CANVAS\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: PORT 2 (your second cable), MIDI channel 11, CC 1 to 16\n   1 Punch-in made in the edit\n   2 Mirror and rotate\n   3 Shake removed in the edit\n   4 Canvas edges\n   5 Camera move added in the edit\n   6 3D frame move\n   7 Focus changed in the edit\n   8 Frame within a frame\n   9 Seen through a screen\n  10 Bursting past the film frame\n  11 The closing circle\n  12 Splitting the screen\n  13 The picture shrinks or grows\n  14 Seeing through a keyhole or binoculars\n  15 A run of still photos\n  16 suite: Kaleidoscope\nCV-CC 2: PORT 2 (your second cable), MIDI channel 11, CC 17 to 32\n   1 suite: Boxed in\n   2 suite: Silent film homage (closing circle)\n   3 suite: Comic book frame\n   4 suite: Two lives on one screen\n   5 suite: The watcher next door\n   6 pair: When the joke pays off, the editor punches in\n   7 pair: When the camera goes handheld, the shake is left in\n   8 pair: When impacts rise, the editor slam zooms\n   9 pair: When the frame spins like a cube, the pace jumps\n  10 pair: When the picture is tilted, the tension rises\n  11 pair: When someone is boxed in by a frame, loneliness grows\n  12 pair: When we watch through a security camera, dread rises\n  13 pair: When the black bars are thick, something breaks out of them\n  14 pair: When the circle closes in, the scene ends\n  15 pair: When the screen splits, the tension climbs\n  16 pair: When the two halves meet, they share one frame\nCV-CC 3: PORT 2 (your second cable), MIDI channel 11, CC 33 to 38\n   1 pair: When the picture shrinks, loneliness grows\n   2 pair: When we watch through the keyhole, dread grows\n   3 pair: When the film turns to still photos, nostalgia comes in\n   4 pair: When someone says something awkward, the camera snaps in on a face\n   5 pairs: The editor tells the joke\n   6 pairs: The frame tells it"
   },
   "pos": [
